[b]Adds new boostables to the game.[/b] This will eventually grow to be a large repository of new boostables for mods to call on.

[b]⭐ FOR PLAYERS:[/b] This is a mod dependency required by certain other mods; it doesn't do anything on its own.
[b]⭐ FOR MODDERS:[/b] You can use these boostables in your own mod by setting this mod as a requirement and calling the boostable's 'Key' values listed below.

[h1][b]🚀 NEW BOOSTABLES[/b][/h1]
[i]*All info below can be found in-game in the same place as vanilla boosters: by going to the Technology page and clicking the [b]+++[/b] icon in the top right.[/i]

[quote]
[quote]
[h2][b]🆕 Mechanic + Boostable "Fear"[/b][/h2]
[hr][b]Key:[/b] BATTLE_FEAR  [b]Category:[/b] Battle
[b]Description:[/b] [/hr]
[/quote]
[h2][b]🆕 Boostable "Slavers"[/b][/h2]
[hr][b]Key:[/b] ROOM__SLAVER  [b]Category:[/b] Buildings
[b]Description:[/b] Increases the submission stat of slaves processed by the Slaver building.[/hr]
[i]*There were no modifiers for the Slaver building in vanilla. Now, with this booster you can increase the value of slaves the player has converted from prisoners themselves (aka the Slaver building) over slaves they merely traded for.[/i]
[/quote]
[quote]
[h2][b]🆕 Boostable "Cannibals"[/b][/h2]
[hr][b]Key:[/b] ROOM__CANNIBAL  [b]Category:[/b] Buildings
[b]Description:[/b] Multiplies the amount of resources gained when a corpse is butchered at a    
Cannibal Room.[/hr]
[/quote]

[h1][b]✏️ TO-DO[/b][/h1]
•️ I'll be adding more boostables over time. I originally made this for my Aruan CaC Addon, but I intend to grow this into a larger repository of many new boosters that future mods can use.
•️ Might make custom icons for new boosters (right now they use existing vanilla icons).

[h1][b]⚙️ INSTALLATION[/b][/h1]
⭐ This is a forced-init script mod. It will always run as long as you enable the mod in your launcher. 
⭐ This script now works on existing saves! New game not required.
⭐ Put this mod [b]at the top of your load order[/b], before any mods requiring this mod (before = a smaller number than dependent mods)

[quote]
️• Made for v70.
️• This script now works on existing saves! New game not required.
️• Should be OK to remove mid-save, but make a backup first.
️• Should be compatible with everything that doesn't modify the slave conversion code (no mods do this to my knowledge).
[/quote]

